#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "vs desktop shell"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:100
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|              | Electron `src/app/shell/desktop`      | Capacitor `src/app/shell/mobile`             |\n"
"| ------------ | ------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Injection    | preload → `window.satelliteShell`     | Hub SPA `bootstrap-capacitor` → API          |\n"
"| Hub config   | 设置 → 连接 → 桌面 prefs              | 设置 → 连接 → Preferences                    |\n"
"| Debug/Sentry | Settings → Debug                      | Settings → Debug                             |\n"
"| REST         | Direct `hubUrl/hub/rpc/v1/*` (Bearer) | Direct `hubUrl/hub/rpc/v1/*` (CORS + Bearer) |\n"
"| instance_id  | File `~/.anima/satellites/chat/`      | Preferences                                  |\n"
"| Content      | 安装包内 web/dist + companion         | 安装包内 web/dist                            |\n"
msgstr ""
